---
source: crates/ascmearc-core/src/mapgen/tunnels_tests.rs
expression: "describe_in(&FIXTURE, &floor(id, seed))"
---
Skeul Hir (skeul_hir:1) 120x30
stairs Up at (5, 3) -> lytelscraef:2
stairs Down at (114, 18) -> gimmwic
place a whistling door at (35, 21): Wind sings through its cracks.
place a sweating door at (35, 23): Water beads on it and runs.
place a door in a stone frame at (45, 21): Grit sifts from under it.
place a scorched door at (45, 23): Heat comes through it.
place Jacca's stone at (88, 21): A deep gnome in stone, no taller than a child, a cutting rod in one hand and the other flat on a step. Cut in the plinth: POWES, HA KERDH YN-RAG. Rest, and walk on. Below it, smaller, a cutter's joke: WHAT US KEEPS, US KEEPS IN THE WALL.

